<title>POLAND: Polish shoe maker Ariel wants bourse entry Oct 14.</title>
<headline>Polish shoe maker Ariel wants bourse entry Oct 14.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish shoe maker Ariel SA wants to enter the parallel market of the Warsaw Stock Exchange on October 14, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company will have one million shares listed, after they were cleared for bourse trade in September.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
